-- Prime ideals of a bundled ring: PrimeIdeal(R, I) under a ring hypothesis,
-- the bridges to the form over separate pieces, the factor laws, and the
-- primality of maximal ideals in a commutative ring; everything here is ZF
-- Part of Cumulus, the Grace17 mathematics library.
